  "energy": "E = 1/(32 sqrt2 pi^2) Int [ d_i phi.d_i phi + 1/2 (d_i phi x d_j phi)^2 ] d^3x (Sutcliffe 2007); Ward conjecture E >= Q^{3/4}; proven E >= (3/16)^{3/8} Q^{3/4}",
